  "description": "Emitted when a swap is unwound (explicitly, or through cancelling either leg). `refund_a` / `refund_b` are the netted offsets returned to each leg's sender; `settled_a` / `settled_b` are the cumulative accruals the swap discharged. Both streams are back on their original routing.",
